{"text": "Osburn, Beth\n\nFrom: MWeinstein@coj.net\nSent: Wednesday, February 28, 2018 8:39 PM\nTo: Tutor, Tyra\nSubject: Re: Kids Hope Alliance scheduling\n\nWe can take as long as necessary. It\u2019s all tentative. No rush. The 180 days runs until April 18 | believe. The board can ask\ncouncil for an extension or ask to bring on a different interim if the board desires. I\u2019m ok either way. I\u2019m enjoying the\nchallenge but there are other responsibilities I\u2019m handling. No problem for me if we need to extend\n\nSent from my iPhone\n\nOn Feb 28, 2018, at 6:00 PM, Tutor, Tyra <Tyra.Tutor@adeccogroup.com> wrote:\n\nDear Team,\n\n| will be speaking at an event in DC on April 4-5, which can\u2019t be moved. However, | will move other\ncommitments so | can participate in this important committee.\n\n| do want to caution that this search timeline seems aggressive. | would like to suggest that we keep an\nopen mind to pushing out the timing, if necessary. We may need more time if other committee\nmembers have conflicts, or we decide we want to vet the final candidates more thoroughly, or we\ndecide to do a broader search to obtain more applicants. Please note that | am traveling and have not\nhad the opportunity to see the application notebooks delivered yesterday.\n\nMike, if we decide to push out the timing, what alternatives do we have for interim leadership, assuming\na scenario where we don\u2019t appoint a CEO before your interim position expires.\n\nKind regards,\nTyra Tutor\n\nOn Feb 27, 2018, at 11:21 AM, Weinstein, Michael <MWeinstein@coj.net> wrote:\n\nIn an attempt to work through the CEO search and our March and April Board meetings\nthe following tentative schedule is proposed.\n\nCEO Search: The Board Search Committee will receive their application notebooks\neither later today or tomorrow.\nThe applicant score sheets should be returned to Diane Moser by Wednesday\nMarch 7\".\nFriday March 16\" the search committee will interview the selected applicants\nby skype\nThursday April 5\" the search committee will interview the finalists in person\n\nBoard Meetings Schedule: The March meeting will be held on Wednesday April 4\"\nThe April meeting will be held April 25\"\n\nA special Board meeting will be held Thursday April 5\" to receive the CEO Search\nCommittee recommendation and take appropriate action",
